---
import LayoutPage from '../../layouts/LayoutPage.astro';
---

<LayoutPage title="Foldster's Projects — Services" description="Transparent pricing for creator-experience packages">
  <h1>Services &amp; Pricing</h1>
  <p class="lede"><em>Four service tiers plus a donation option. Published pricing. Code and assets shipped is yours. No DRM, no subscription lock-in.</em></p>

  <aside class="launch-banner">
    <span class="badge mono">Launch pricing</span>
    <p>
      <strong>40&thinsp;% off the published rates for the first 3 paid clients.</strong>
      Real discount, real cap &mdash; once the case studies are shipped, prices ratchet back to the listed rates.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <ul class="entry-list">
    <li id="asset-pack" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Asset Pack</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$600 – $1,200</span> <strong class="price-now">$360 – $720</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>A coordinated bundle of static deliverables &mdash; an overlay set (BRB / starting / intermission), a small 3D-print collection, a graphics suite, a one-shot tool kit. No live data, no integrations. You walk away with the files.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A set of matching static assets (overlay scene pack, 3D-print collection, graphics suite, or one-shot tool kit)</li>
          <li>Color + type matched to your existing brand</li>
          <li>Source files included &mdash; what's shipped is yours</li>
          <li>1–2 week delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li id="live-integration" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Live Integration</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$2,000 – $3,500</span> <strong class="price-now">$1,200 – $2,100</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>A tool wired into a live data source &mdash; Twitch events, chat, follows / subs / raids, your Bluesky feed, a Discord channel. Reactive overlays, custom bots, interactive widgets. Most stream-side projects land here.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Reactive overlay or interactive widget</li>
          <li>Live data: Twitch EventSub, chat, follows / subs / raids, Bluesky / social feeds</li>
          <li>Bot tuned to your voice</li>
          <li>3–5 week delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li id="end-to-end" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>End-to-End Pipeline</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$5,000 – $10,000</span> <strong class="price-now">$3,000 – $6,000</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>A live tool <strong>plus</strong> an on-demand outbound service &mdash; a viewer-triggered merch print, a chat-driven e-commerce drop, a scheduled action that touches the physical world. Multiple systems orchestrated to feel like one.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Everything in Live Integration</li>
          <li>On-demand outbound service (3D-print fulfillment, Printful drop, scheduled action, e-commerce hook)</li>
          <li>Multi-system orchestration with shared state</li>
          <li>6–10 week delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li id="partnership" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Ongoing Tooling Partnership</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$500 – $1,000 / month</span> <strong class="price-now">$300 – $600 / month</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>For shipped work that needs to keep growing &mdash; monthly feature additions, maintenance, scheduled drops. Cancel anytime.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Monthly feature additions</li>
          <li>Bug fixes + maintenance on shipped work</li>
          <li>Scheduled drops or recurring runs (for End-to-End Pipeline clients)</li>
          <li>Cancel anytime</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li id="donation" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Donation</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Support | <strong class="price-now">pay what you want</strong></em></p>
        <p>Keep the free tools running. Donations go toward server costs, ongoing development, and shipping more free tools &mdash; no project deliverable in return, just gratitude.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Supports Demowall, Demodrip, Demosky, Palettope, Emotions.dev &mdash; and whatever ships next</li>
          <li>Server + domain hosting on the free tools</li>
          <li>One-off or recurring &mdash; both work</li>
          <li>Reach out via the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> and we&rsquo;ll set up your preferred channel (Ko-fi, GitHub Sponsors, direct)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <a href="/contact/" class="cta" slot="cta">Start your Own Project &rarr;</a>
</LayoutPage>

<style>
  .launch-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    background: var(--color-vellum);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-deep-tidewater);
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.75rem;
    font-family: "iA Writer Quattro", monospace;
  }
  .launch-banner .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-deep-tidewater);
    color: var(--color-vellum);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
  .launch-banner p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #2c3d42;
  }

  .price-was {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.55;
    margin-right: 0.4rem;
  }
  .price-now {
    color: var(--color-deep-tidewater);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
